# mod-auto-loot: a corpse is auto-looted by its loot recipient only (player report
# 2026-10-29: a player standing beside another player's kills looted them away from him).
# Two solo bots side by side at a natural spawn of "Squealer" Thornmantle (3229, Squealer's Tusk 4951
# at 100 %; a temp spawn leaves no corpse); k kills it, o only stands within 10 yd. o gets nothing, k
# gets the tusk.
name    Auto loot - only the killer's own corpses are looted
timeout 60s

bot k warrior slot=6
bot o warrior slot=7
group none

place 1 -3104.0 -1205.0 85.6 0
require k alive
require o alive
pick b creature:3229 near k alive
require b exists
# the director has auto-loot too: out of reach (40 yd)
do gm goto -3104.0 -1245.0 85.6
do k approach b
do k attack b
waitfor b dead timeout 20s
wait 3s
expect o item 4951 == 0
expect k item 4951 >= 1

cleanup
do k stop
do k destroy 4951
do o destroy 4951
